WEBVTT

01:45.110 --> 01:46.509
You're sitting on my leg.

01:58.840 --> 01:59.759
Still angry?

02:01.070 --> 02:01.920
I wouldn't dare.

02:02.200 --> 02:02.950
You can go ask around.

02:03.790 --> 02:04.590
In all of Zhongguancun,

02:05.070 --> 02:07.000
which employee dares to get angry with their boss?

02:09.350 --> 02:10.030
You must be hungry.

02:10.150 --> 02:11.710
I'll make you some wagyu fried rice.

02:11.710 --> 02:12.030
Okay.

02:12.150 --> 02:12.710
He's not deserving.

02:15.080 --> 02:15.840
Fine.

02:17.120 --> 02:17.750
I don't deserve it.

02:20.360 --> 02:21.360
Go ahead and cook.

02:21.680 --> 02:22.680
I'll eat after you're done.

02:22.950 --> 02:24.160
Mr. Xie can watch from the sidelines.

02:25.560 --> 02:26.790
We'll use Mr. Xie's wagyu, okay?

02:27.030 --> 02:28.750
Use as much as you want. There's plenty.

02:29.680 --> 02:31.000
There's just one piece.

02:31.150 --> 02:31.800
It seems like...

02:32.520 --> 02:33.190
you're going to vomit?

02:36.000 --> 02:36.750
Mind your own business.

02:37.000 --> 02:38.310
Look at your antics.

02:39.190 --> 02:40.400
You must have learned this from Xiaohui.

02:41.560 --> 02:42.750
So coquettish.

02:42.750 --> 02:44.560
If you put on a finger cuff,

02:44.560 --> 02:46.000
you'd be the spitting image of Concubine Hua.

02:46.000 --> 02:47.590
If you can’t say anything right,

02:47.590 --> 02:49.710
why not donate your mouth to someone who does?

02:55.079 --> 02:55.560
Bro.

02:57.079 --> 02:57.720
Brother Kuo.

02:59.150 --> 03:00.080
I'm sorry, okay?

03:02.680 --> 03:03.710
Should I kneel down to you?

03:04.310 --> 03:05.310
Fine, go ahead.

03:06.270 --> 03:06.840
Come on.

03:08.240 --> 03:08.710
Kneel.

03:15.470 --> 03:16.750
What’s wrong with you?

03:23.680 --> 03:24.960
I've been under a lot of pressure lately.

03:26.150 --> 03:26.800
I know.

03:29.430 --> 03:30.430
Yuntu...

03:31.360 --> 03:32.590
has been really tough to deal with.

03:33.030 --> 03:34.710
And I suspect that they have their informants

03:35.030 --> 03:36.030
within our organization,

03:36.960 --> 03:39.240
keeping an eye on our every move.

03:39.870 --> 03:41.870
Otherwise, there’s no way they’d strike back this quickly

03:42.150 --> 03:43.079
and this accurately.

03:44.590 --> 03:45.360
What should we do then?

03:47.960 --> 03:48.750
No matter what comes,

03:49.030 --> 03:49.960
we'll tackle it head-on.

03:53.310 --> 03:55.750
As long as the three of us brothers

03:56.590 --> 03:57.560
stand in solidarity

03:58.190 --> 03:59.000
and work hard enough,

04:00.590 --> 04:01.710
we will never lose.

04:02.630 --> 04:03.150
Yes!

04:04.280 --> 04:04.870
It's ready.

04:05.000 --> 04:05.720
Let's eat.

04:13.910 --> 04:14.270
Smells good!

04:14.310 --> 04:14.750
And delicious!

04:17.269 --> 04:18.110
You know, these cartoons

04:18.110 --> 04:19.040
never seem to get past

04:19.040 --> 04:19.680
the first half.

04:19.870 --> 04:21.040
When will they make the second half?

04:22.040 --> 04:23.310
Once our company goes public,

04:23.830 --> 04:24.830
we'll force them to make it.

04:25.190 --> 04:25.870
It must be produced.

04:26.000 --> 04:26.600
Yes!

04:27.160 --> 04:28.480
It has to be "Saint Seiya",

04:28.720 --> 04:30.480
"Naruto" or "One Piece".

04:31.430 --> 04:31.830
We'll make them!

04:33.190 --> 04:34.360
If they're not willing,

04:34.920 --> 04:36.360
I'll throw money at them to make it happen.

04:36.600 --> 04:37.430
What else?

04:37.480 --> 04:40.120
"Tiny Tadpoles Cause Havoc in Heaven"

04:40.630 --> 04:42.040
Isn't that going a bit too far?

04:42.040 --> 04:42.560
Well, I like it.

04:42.560 --> 04:42.920
Make it!

04:43.480 --> 04:43.920
Make it!

04:44.240 --> 04:45.430
Throw money at them to make it.

04:45.480 --> 04:45.920
Make it!

04:59.040 --> 05:04.310
♫Holding on to freedom through the storm♫

05:06.600 --> 05:07.000
Have one.

05:07.600 --> 05:09.040
Just eat one. It won't hurt for now.

05:09.310 --> 05:09.750
No, I won't.

05:10.320 --> 05:11.040
Forget it if he doesn't want to.

05:11.190 --> 05:12.310
Let him work in peace for now.

05:12.430 --> 05:12.870
I'll eat it.

05:13.360 --> 05:14.150
You can work him to death,

05:14.150 --> 05:14.870
but if he does it alone,

05:14.870 --> 05:16.040
it won’t make a difference.

05:16.310 --> 05:17.000
Let me tell you.

05:17.990 --> 05:19.750
If you're serious about improving delivery efficiency,

05:19.920 --> 05:21.000
the key lies in the frontliners.

05:21.120 --> 05:22.120
They're doing the actual work.

05:22.870 --> 05:23.600
I want to give it a try.

05:24.750 --> 05:25.920
You want to do food delivery yourself?

05:26.600 --> 05:27.600
When we were kids playing games,

05:27.600 --> 05:28.600
didn't we also pick the toughest one

05:28.750 --> 05:30.600
and secretly watched how others played?

05:31.310 --> 05:32.070
Xingchi,

05:32.920 --> 05:33.750
I'm very grateful

05:34.430 --> 05:35.310
that you're willing to help me.

05:37.600 --> 05:38.270
What about me?

05:38.920 --> 05:39.600
Who are you?

05:39.920 --> 05:40.560
What's your name?

05:42.230 --> 05:42.800
Driver,

05:43.070 --> 05:44.720
just drop us off here.

05:45.270 --> 05:45.830
Let us out!

05:46.680 --> 05:47.159
Hey buddy...

05:47.159 --> 05:48.120
I'm quitting! Let me out!

05:48.120 --> 05:48.680
Pull up!

05:51.159 --> 05:51.990
Who is this?

05:52.720 --> 05:53.680
He has completed 500 orders.

05:54.360 --> 05:55.510
Still two orders short of 500.

05:56.040 --> 05:57.680
And this person just joined last month.

05:58.040 --> 05:58.830
Call him over.

06:07.390 --> 06:08.160
He Tianming.

06:09.070 --> 06:09.680
That's me.

06:12.070 --> 06:13.680
Why do you look familiar?

06:14.120 --> 06:15.630
Have I seen you somewhere before?

06:15.950 --> 06:16.870
Where have you worked before?

06:17.190 --> 06:18.240
At Fenghua's place.

06:19.750 --> 06:21.600
Fenghua? Xia Fenghua?

06:21.870 --> 06:22.270
Yes.

06:22.750 --> 06:24.070
I used to deliver parcels for Fenghua.

06:24.750 --> 06:25.310
I know all the routes.

06:26.070 --> 06:27.430
But others know the routes too.

06:27.830 --> 06:29.430
How did you manage to complete 500 orders?

06:30.000 --> 06:30.870
Besides knowing the routes,

06:31.120 --> 06:32.560
I also had to strategically plan the routes

06:32.870 --> 06:35.070
and maintain good relationships with merchants and customers.

06:35.190 --> 06:35.950
How do you maintain them?

06:36.070 --> 06:36.960
With a friendly attitude

06:37.120 --> 06:37.950
and swift actions,

06:38.510 --> 06:39.720
once a good relationship has been established,

06:39.830 --> 06:42.000
even new customers can become regulars.

06:43.310 --> 06:43.870
That's great.

06:44.870 --> 06:45.560
Have you done any management work?

06:46.190 --> 06:48.310
I did some operations work for Fenghua for a while.

06:48.950 --> 06:49.510
However,

06:49.950 --> 06:51.920
parcel and food delivery are inherently different.

06:52.190 --> 06:53.310
I'm still learning the ropes.

06:55.070 --> 06:55.510
Li.

06:56.870 --> 06:58.510
You should have the delivery riders

06:58.720 --> 06:59.830
chat with He more often.

07:00.190 --> 07:02.160
Have him share his insights with everyone.

07:02.950 --> 07:03.430
It'll be useful.

07:04.430 --> 07:05.310
You can go now.

07:05.830 --> 07:06.190
Alright.

07:06.430 --> 07:06.680
Okay.

07:12.950 --> 07:13.590
Fenghua...

07:15.190 --> 07:16.270
How is she doing lately?

07:16.830 --> 07:17.560
Fenghua has a big heart.

07:17.870 --> 07:19.750
She always says that managers should lead by example,

07:20.190 --> 07:21.310
so she's exhausted every day.

07:22.270 --> 07:23.870
Previously, she hurt her back while working.

07:24.190 --> 07:25.480
It aches on cloudy and rainy days.

07:27.630 --> 07:27.870
Alright.

07:28.750 --> 07:29.510
Keep up the good work.

07:29.830 --> 07:31.430
If you need anything in the future, come to me directly.

07:32.390 --> 07:33.070
Thank you, Mr. Xie.

07:33.070 --> 07:33.630
You can go now.

07:39.870 --> 07:40.630
Back aches?

07:48.390 --> 07:49.190
Just take a look.

07:50.720 --> 07:52.430
The delivery rider who previously delivered the most orders

07:52.950 --> 07:55.120
had some tips for planning routes.

07:55.310 --> 07:56.310
I asked him to compile them.

07:57.000 --> 07:58.040
See if you can

07:58.070 --> 07:59.070
use his ideas

07:59.630 --> 08:00.750
to improve the application.

08:04.720 --> 08:05.950
This is interesting.

08:07.070 --> 08:07.430
Here,

08:08.320 --> 08:09.000
take a look at this.

08:09.630 --> 08:10.950
I had those guys who do street surveys

08:10.950 --> 08:11.920
run a questionnaire.

08:11.950 --> 08:14.720
This counts as first-hand user feedback.

08:18.750 --> 08:19.750
Who created the questionnaire?

08:19.950 --> 08:20.630
I did.

08:21.750 --> 08:23.070
You have that skill?

08:23.830 --> 08:25.320
Are you looking down on me? Do you want it or not?

08:25.320 --> 08:25.950
Yes, I want it.

08:27.560 --> 08:28.830
Can't you just speak nicely?

08:29.270 --> 08:29.750
Alright, alright.

08:29.750 --> 08:30.190
Hurry up.

08:30.190 --> 08:30.750
Get to work.

08:30.750 --> 08:31.350
Okay!

08:54.960 --> 08:55.630
Liu,

08:55.960 --> 08:56.750
did you find it?

08:56.750 --> 08:57.790
Found it, it's here.

08:58.630 --> 08:59.360
Be careful next time, okay?

08:59.440 --> 08:59.910
Alright!

09:00.630 --> 09:01.510
Fenghua, there's one more here.

09:01.960 --> 09:02.840
Is it for Keyuan Nanli?

09:02.870 --> 09:03.390
Yes.

09:04.000 --> 09:04.360
Pass me.

09:05.390 --> 09:06.080
It's quite heavy.

09:11.320 --> 09:12.440
Fenghua, there's a parcel for you.

09:13.630 --> 09:14.270
Mine?

09:43.360 --> 09:44.830
Who's so thoughtful?

09:53.670 --> 09:54.000
Here.

09:54.440 --> 09:54.910
It's for both of you.

09:55.910 --> 09:56.680
I'll leave the money here for you.

09:57.030 --> 09:57.390
Okay.

10:01.480 --> 10:01.870
Hello?

10:01.910 --> 10:02.510
Fenghua?

10:02.750 --> 10:03.360
Mom?

10:04.000 --> 10:05.200
Did you buy me some plasters?

10:05.480 --> 10:06.000
No, I didn't.

10:06.030 --> 10:06.790
What plasters?

10:07.000 --> 10:08.190
Traditional Miao medicinal plasters?

10:08.320 --> 10:09.790
It's a big box of them for back pain.

10:10.550 --> 10:11.390
No, it wasn't me.

10:11.750 --> 10:12.390
You're fine,

10:12.390 --> 10:13.720
so why would I send you plasters?

10:16.270 --> 10:16.870
Alright then.

10:17.750 --> 10:18.080
Okay.

10:18.080 --> 10:19.000
I'm hanging up.

10:29.360 --> 10:29.870
Are you busy?

10:30.600 --> 10:31.080
Yuling.

10:31.390 --> 10:32.550
I'm here for a bowl of savory tofu pudding

10:32.630 --> 10:33.390
and that'll be a meal.

10:33.550 --> 10:34.200
Help yourself.

10:34.270 --> 10:34.630
Okay.

10:34.630 --> 10:35.630
Those bowls are all freshly made.

10:35.790 --> 10:36.200
Alright.

10:36.200 --> 10:37.480
I'll bring the bowl back to you later, okay?

10:38.200 --> 10:38.750
Oh yes, Yuling.

10:39.360 --> 10:40.120
Wait a moment.

10:40.750 --> 10:42.600
I just remembered I had something to tell you.

10:42.870 --> 10:43.240
What is it?

10:43.400 --> 10:45.790
Well... I feel that

10:46.120 --> 10:47.750
Mr. Zhou has been having

10:48.360 --> 10:50.840
some health issues recently.

10:51.600 --> 10:52.480
What kind of issues?

10:52.870 --> 10:55.600
I just was chatting with Mr. Zhou.

10:55.870 --> 10:57.030
When we talked about Granny Ma,

10:57.360 --> 11:00.790
he seemed to have forgotten that Granny Ma had passed away.

11:03.080 --> 11:04.080
Really?

11:04.120 --> 11:05.200
Yes, really.

11:09.000 --> 11:10.240
When did this happen?

11:11.600 --> 11:12.390
It was only the other day

11:12.390 --> 11:13.480
that Yan told me about it.

11:14.360 --> 11:16.360
Has Mr. Zhou experienced something like this before?

11:19.750 --> 11:21.480
Yes, but...

11:22.990 --> 11:24.510
But I've been thinking,

11:24.510 --> 11:26.120
it's normal for people to forget things

11:26.360 --> 11:27.600
as they get older, right?

11:29.120 --> 11:29.870
It is normal.

11:30.390 --> 11:32.870
But isn't it a bit strange to forget

11:33.480 --> 11:34.870
something this significant?

11:37.720 --> 11:38.720
If you ask me, Master Zhou,

11:39.750 --> 11:41.840
why don't you take Grandpa Zhou to the hospital for a check-up?

11:42.240 --> 11:43.510
It's great if nothing is wrong.

11:44.120 --> 11:45.360
But if there's something wrong,

11:46.240 --> 11:47.240
let's not delay any treatment.

11:47.510 --> 11:48.270
What do you think?

11:50.670 --> 11:51.120
You're right.

11:56.990 --> 11:59.550
Be careful when digging for that bottle.

11:59.600 --> 12:01.160
If you're not careful when digging,

12:01.270 --> 12:03.240
it might all shatter.

12:03.390 --> 12:04.510
Even if you dig it out, it might be all broken.

12:04.870 --> 12:05.480
Wouldn't it?

12:05.960 --> 12:06.670
-Dad.
-Yanlin.

12:07.240 --> 12:08.110
You're back.

12:08.360 --> 12:10.000
Chen Rui is having lunch at our restaurant today.

12:10.240 --> 12:11.200
Okay, come on in.

12:11.480 --> 12:12.200
What would you like to eat?

12:12.510 --> 12:13.440
Anything is fine with me.

12:14.630 --> 12:15.720
Let's have something light with

12:15.960 --> 12:16.600
just two or three dishes.

12:16.750 --> 12:18.080
I have to go to the cultural museum this afternoon.

12:18.630 --> 12:19.440
Why don't we just let him

12:19.440 --> 12:20.080
order for himself?

12:20.120 --> 12:21.560
Order whatever you want.

12:21.560 --> 12:22.150
Thank you, Uncle.

12:22.390 --> 12:23.000
Help yourself.

12:24.600 --> 12:25.630
You're going to the cultural museum this afternoon?

12:25.630 --> 12:26.150
Yes.

12:27.240 --> 12:28.550
Don't make any plans for tomorrow, okay?

12:29.120 --> 12:29.750
What for?

12:30.240 --> 12:33.550
I'll take you to the hospital for a health screening.

12:33.750 --> 12:34.320
How about that?

12:34.630 --> 12:35.440
Health screening?

12:37.240 --> 12:38.320
There's nothing wrong with my health.

12:39.600 --> 12:40.840
I know there's nothing wrong with your health.

12:40.840 --> 12:42.600
But doctors advise

12:42.750 --> 12:43.750
that each of us

12:43.750 --> 12:46.000
should have a check-up once a year.

12:46.750 --> 12:47.480
Look at you.

12:47.840 --> 12:48.760
How long has it been since you had one?

12:49.840 --> 12:50.360
Right?

12:51.200 --> 12:52.750
This is called prevention is better than cure.

12:53.270 --> 12:54.750
Besides, it's not troublesome.

12:55.200 --> 12:56.720
It'll be done in just one morning.

12:58.750 --> 13:01.240
Alright, fine.

13:02.510 --> 13:03.360
You have to go too.

13:03.960 --> 13:05.000
You should also get a check-up.

13:05.390 --> 13:05.790
Do you know?

13:05.840 --> 13:07.870
Once you hit middle age, your body doesn’t hold up as well anymore.

13:08.110 --> 13:08.480
Isn't it?

13:08.870 --> 13:10.270
Anything’s better than falling ill.

13:11.240 --> 13:11.870
You must come.

13:12.390 --> 13:12.750
Alright?

13:12.870 --> 13:13.480
-Okay then.
-Right?

13:14.000 --> 13:16.630
So it turns out you're accompanying me for the check-up tomorrow.

13:30.960 --> 13:31.390
How much?

13:31.750 --> 13:32.390
Hello, it's 40 yuan.

13:32.720 --> 13:33.000
Okay.

13:37.120 --> 13:37.360
Here you go.

13:37.630 --> 13:38.240
Okay, thank you.

13:38.600 --> 13:39.120
Take care.

14:06.720 --> 14:07.390
Don't push! Don't push!

14:07.630 --> 14:09.200
Line up! Line up!

14:09.750 --> 14:11.030
There are tickets for everyone!

14:12.360 --> 14:14.870
What options are there for this concert?

14:15.120 --> 14:16.000
What price do you want?

14:16.720 --> 14:18.240
We have options between

14:18.240 --> 14:18.870
380 to 2,680 yuan.

14:18.870 --> 14:19.840
Stop pushing.

14:21.360 --> 14:22.080
So expensive?

14:25.750 --> 14:26.480
Hey, are you buying or not?

14:26.630 --> 14:27.960
If you're not buying, step aside.

14:28.120 --> 14:28.910
I'm buying.

14:29.270 --> 14:29.790
I'll buy.

14:31.000 --> 14:32.550
Two tickets at 1,280 yuan each.

14:36.120 --> 14:36.750
Next.

14:40.360 --> 14:41.360
Wait, I’m still here!

14:50.750 --> 14:51.870
Stop! Hold on!

14:59.480 --> 15:00.080
Listen,

15:00.200 --> 15:02.000
these orders must be delivered today.

15:02.840 --> 15:03.880
Otherwise, we'll get complaints again.

15:04.120 --> 15:05.120
Thanks for your hard work. Hurry up.

15:05.120 --> 15:05.670
Alright, Fenghua.

15:09.870 --> 15:10.630
Ms. Xia.

15:11.480 --> 15:13.390
I've been calling you from behind. Couldn't you hear me?

15:14.480 --> 15:16.000
Can't you see I'm busy?

15:23.960 --> 15:24.720
What are you here for?

15:27.750 --> 15:28.630
I need your help with something.

15:30.750 --> 15:32.910
Mr. Xie, you're not here to personally poach employees, are you?

15:33.360 --> 15:35.630
If you poach any more, we'll have to close down.

15:36.750 --> 15:37.750
I wouldn't do that in person.

15:38.000 --> 15:39.600
I usually do that behind your back instead.

15:44.750 --> 15:45.360
What?

15:46.240 --> 15:46.790
See for yourself.

15:55.840 --> 15:57.870
I thought someone didn't want to go.

16:07.200 --> 16:09.480
I didn't see anything!

16:11.080 --> 16:12.310
Nothing at all.

16:13.080 --> 16:14.120
Watch your behaviour.

16:17.840 --> 16:19.240
Looks like I'll have to scold you more often in the future.

16:20.870 --> 16:22.240
I called you cold-blooded previously,

16:22.480 --> 16:24.200
and you are giving me tickets now because you felt bad.

16:24.870 --> 16:26.120
Next time, I'll be even harsher.

16:26.440 --> 16:27.440
Let's see what you'll give me then.

16:33.790 --> 16:34.440
Chris.

16:38.320 --> 16:38.670
Okay.

16:39.790 --> 16:40.600
I'll treat you to a meal later.

16:41.080 --> 16:42.080
No need to be polite.

16:43.350 --> 16:44.630
You haven't changed your WeChat ID, right?

16:45.000 --> 16:45.720
No, it's still the same.

16:46.000 --> 16:47.000
Alright, take it easy.

16:47.390 --> 16:47.870
I'll be off!

16:51.120 --> 16:52.360
-Bro.
-Where's Fenghua?

16:53.000 --> 16:53.390
She went out.

16:53.840 --> 16:54.360
She went out?

16:54.760 --> 16:55.200
Where did she go?

16:55.360 --> 16:56.000
To watch a concert.

16:57.270 --> 16:58.000
She's going alone?

16:58.160 --> 16:59.240
She went with Mr. Xie from Bee Group.

16:59.320 --> 17:00.270
He came by with the tickets.

17:00.350 --> 17:01.200
They just left a while ago.

17:03.240 --> 17:03.960
Anything else?

17:03.960 --> 17:04.920
I have some parcels to deliver.

18:26.160 --> 18:26.830
Wanghe.

18:28.400 --> 18:30.270
I've dreamt of this scene

18:31.160 --> 18:32.070
more than once.

18:39.030 --> 18:40.600
Do you really think I'll make it one day?

18:41.240 --> 18:41.790
Of course!

18:43.000 --> 18:44.510
I've always believed that

18:45.440 --> 18:47.350
you can definitely create miracles.

18:48.310 --> 18:49.030
So,

18:50.510 --> 18:52.270
please have faith in yourself too.

18:59.310 --> 19:00.160
Xie Wanghe,

19:01.400 --> 19:02.400
I cherish you.

19:05.680 --> 19:06.510
If you get in,

19:06.510 --> 19:08.230
I'll set up a breakfast stand at your school gate.

19:08.230 --> 19:09.750
I'll tell everyone I meet that I was your first love

19:09.750 --> 19:10.960
and I was abandoned by you.

19:11.110 --> 19:13.400
My girlfriend wouldn't have a lisp.

19:15.790 --> 19:17.270
The bride is so beautiful!

19:17.270 --> 19:18.960
When I grow up, I want to have my wedding on a ship too.

19:19.590 --> 19:21.390
You're talking as if you could even get married.

19:21.750 --> 19:22.590
If no one wants me,

19:22.710 --> 19:24.110
I'll marry Wanghe.

19:24.200 --> 19:25.030
I'll pass.

19:25.030 --> 19:26.030
You're a glutton.

19:26.030 --> 19:27.640
My family will go bankrupt from feeding you.

19:28.350 --> 19:28.830
What are you doing?

19:28.830 --> 19:29.310
You're injured now,

19:29.510 --> 19:30.750
so I must take care of you.

19:33.720 --> 19:34.120
How is it?

19:35.480 --> 19:36.030
A bit higher.

19:39.480 --> 19:40.830
It's unlikely you will get into a university.

19:41.030 --> 19:42.590
When I head north to start my own business,

19:43.350 --> 19:45.480
you can use that money to invest in my company.

19:46.030 --> 19:47.070
I'll lead you to riches.

19:47.310 --> 19:48.000
In the future,

19:48.310 --> 19:49.510
you'll be President Xia.

19:51.750 --> 19:52.350
Okay.

19:52.790 --> 19:53.880
That's your own words.

19:54.240 --> 19:55.000
No backing out.

19:56.030 --> 19:56.750
I said it.

19:56.960 --> 19:57.880
I won't back out.

20:23.240 --> 20:24.070
Want to grab supper?

20:25.200 --> 20:27.070
I'm fine either way. I'm not really hungry.

20:28.000 --> 20:29.310
Love is enough to fill you up, huh?

20:33.750 --> 20:35.000
Can you take a photo of me too?

20:44.750 --> 20:46.200
One, two, three.

20:49.640 --> 20:50.480
Let's take one together.

20:55.590 --> 20:56.790
Stop looking so tense.

20:56.790 --> 20:57.920
It's not like we're taking a funeral photo.

20:58.240 --> 20:58.680
Smile.

21:00.920 --> 21:02.400
Be more sincere!

21:05.240 --> 21:07.160
Look at how her husband lets her take photos as she pleases.

21:07.200 --> 21:07.960
You though, it's like

21:08.070 --> 21:09.480
I'm asking for your life every time we take one.

21:09.750 --> 21:10.480
Darling, I'm sorry.

21:10.480 --> 21:11.640
Let's go home and keep it down.

21:11.680 --> 21:12.480
This is so embarrassing.

21:16.990 --> 21:17.680
What do you want to eat?

21:21.400 --> 21:21.960
Eel noodles.

21:22.750 --> 21:23.510
It's late.

21:23.510 --> 21:24.920
Where am I supposed to find eel noodles at this hour?

21:26.640 --> 21:27.920
There's a good crayfish place nearby.

21:28.160 --> 21:30.030
I used to go there often with Xingchi and Haikuo.

21:30.030 --> 21:31.070
Why didn't you invite me?

21:31.240 --> 21:32.830
Back then, I was just starting out as a courier.

21:33.030 --> 21:34.270
I barely had time to even sleep.

21:34.920 --> 21:35.750
Well, you could have at least

21:35.750 --> 21:37.070
brought me some takeout.

21:37.310 --> 21:39.720
It's not too late to treat you now.

21:47.000 --> 21:47.400
Sit down.

21:47.830 --> 21:48.400
Waiter!

21:49.160 --> 21:51.200
Bring us 30 chilled crayfish,

21:51.200 --> 21:51.790
the biggest ones you have,

21:52.070 --> 21:53.070
and two bottles of soda too.

21:53.400 --> 21:54.030
Alright!

21:56.270 --> 21:57.070
Back then,

21:57.960 --> 21:59.270
Haikuo had a fight with his mom.

21:59.790 --> 22:01.350
Xingchi's karaoke studio got shut down.

22:01.640 --> 22:02.030
And me?

22:02.480 --> 22:03.200
My startup had failed.

22:04.000 --> 22:06.160
The three of us would come here every day to drink.

22:06.480 --> 22:08.240
When we got drunk, we'd hug each other and cry our hearts out.

22:09.680 --> 22:11.000
No wonder you wouldn't invite me.

22:11.480 --> 22:12.920
Afraid I would see you embarrass yourself?

22:13.310 --> 22:14.510
With that mouth of yours,

22:14.750 --> 22:16.070
if you had seen that scene,

22:16.400 --> 22:17.750
you'd nag about it for the rest of your life.

22:18.830 --> 22:20.550
Am I really that immature in your eyes?

22:22.310 --> 22:22.880
It's not that.

22:24.030 --> 22:25.960
You're carefree and easygoing.

22:26.480 --> 22:28.480
A lot of things don't bother you.

22:30.720 --> 22:31.200
Here it comes.

22:33.310 --> 22:33.750
Give it to me.

22:36.030 --> 22:36.590
Thank you.

22:37.160 --> 22:38.750
Okay, thanks.

22:39.480 --> 22:40.030
Eat up.

22:46.480 --> 22:47.750
Didn't you always say that

22:48.270 --> 22:49.310
you've always seen me as a brother?

22:50.790 --> 22:52.160
So why is it that when something happens,

22:52.480 --> 22:53.640
you see me as a woman?

22:55.480 --> 22:56.240
You're nitpicking now?

22:57.830 --> 22:59.200
I just want to know

22:59.920 --> 23:01.680
when you see me as a brother

23:02.240 --> 23:03.510
and when you see me as a woman?

23:05.000 --> 23:05.790
Well...

23:05.790 --> 23:06.440
For example, right now,

23:07.830 --> 23:10.350
do you see me as a brother or a woman?

23:14.640 --> 23:15.750
You're a child.

23:18.830 --> 23:21.550
Look at the mess you're making from eating crayfish as an adult.

23:22.350 --> 23:23.200
Unbelievable.

23:29.680 --> 23:31.480
Waiter, check please.

23:36.960 --> 23:37.510
Hello.

23:39.550 --> 23:40.640
That'll be 150 yuan in total.

23:48.110 --> 23:48.720
Thank you.

23:48.830 --> 23:49.880
Hope to see you again.

24:01.200 --> 24:03.270
Can you live a little more carefully from now on?

24:03.790 --> 24:05.160
Don't be so scatterbrained,

24:05.160 --> 24:06.720
or always acting like you're a tough guy.

24:09.720 --> 24:11.030
Well, if I live carefully enough,

24:11.480 --> 24:12.910
will you treat me like a woman?

24:20.880 --> 24:21.920
That depends on you.

24:23.480 --> 24:24.160
Depends on me?

24:24.760 --> 24:25.480
What for?

24:57.880 --> 24:59.070
Why aren't you saying anything?

25:01.880 --> 25:03.160
I'm thinking about something.

25:06.960 --> 25:07.880
Tell me.

25:08.830 --> 25:10.350
If Siyi hadn't left back then

25:10.680 --> 25:11.750
and had also got into a Beijing university,

25:12.160 --> 25:13.310
what would it be like now?

25:17.270 --> 25:18.400
Life has no 'what ifs.'

25:19.350 --> 25:20.470
Just think about it.

25:21.790 --> 25:22.480
It's meaningless.

25:25.480 --> 25:26.590
Then let me ask you this.

25:27.960 --> 25:30.200
If my dad had sold the ship back then,

25:30.400 --> 25:31.350
raised some more money,

25:31.750 --> 25:33.630
and had bought initial stocks of the big companies,

25:34.240 --> 25:35.590
what would life be like now?

25:36.400 --> 25:37.720
So it's all pointless.

25:40.870 --> 25:42.400
We can think about the future though.

25:43.110 --> 25:44.400
When Bee goes public,

25:44.680 --> 25:45.920
I'll have complete financial independence.

25:46.510 --> 25:47.350
By then,

25:47.680 --> 25:49.400
I can buy an apartment in Beijing,

25:49.920 --> 25:51.200
a three-bedroom one.

25:52.880 --> 25:54.480
If you're financially independent,

25:54.640 --> 25:55.750
why not buy a villa?

25:56.550 --> 25:58.270
I can't spend all the money.

25:58.480 --> 26:00.070
I still have to support my wife and kids.

26:01.200 --> 26:02.590
So what kind of woman do you want to marry?

26:05.640 --> 26:06.200
A woman.

26:09.000 --> 26:09.920
Someone I'm familiar with

26:11.160 --> 26:12.480
and know very well.

26:14.790 --> 26:17.200
At the very least, she must have good character.

26:18.000 --> 26:20.550
Warm-hearted, filial, and generous.

26:21.680 --> 26:23.270
I don't expect her to be understanding all the time,

26:23.790 --> 26:25.000
but she can't be petty either.

26:26.590 --> 26:28.240
It'll be great if she's easily pacified

26:28.750 --> 26:30.110
and is not too career-oriented,

26:30.480 --> 26:31.760
but she must have a sense of responsibility.

26:32.000 --> 26:33.950
She should be able to take good care of those around her.

26:34.510 --> 26:35.680
It's okay if she generally doesn't dress up,

26:36.440 --> 26:39.000
but then looks great with just a touch of lipstick.

26:40.590 --> 26:42.350
When she occasionally wears high heels,

26:42.750 --> 26:46.110
she'll have the presence of a supermodel.

26:49.590 --> 26:52.160
There's someone like that at Bee's headquarters.

26:55.030 --> 26:57.030
Too bad she's married.

26:59.070 --> 27:00.030
Why don't you ask her to get divorced then?

27:00.550 --> 27:01.510
That's not right.

27:01.790 --> 27:03.720
Wouldn't that affect her blissful life?

27:04.480 --> 27:05.920
I don't know if she's happy or not,

27:06.310 --> 27:07.310
but as for you,

27:07.480 --> 27:08.750
you definitely wouldn't be happy.

27:12.440 --> 27:13.680
Don't talk nonsense.

27:34.510 --> 27:35.510
Be careful on the road.

27:35.680 --> 27:36.160
Good night.

27:36.310 --> 27:36.880
Good night.

27:50.960 --> 27:51.510
What's wrong?

27:54.160 --> 27:55.440
You were the one who bought those

27:55.720 --> 27:56.590
Miao medicinal plasters, right?

27:58.200 --> 27:58.750
No.

28:02.720 --> 28:04.310
It's a local herbal remedy

28:04.960 --> 28:06.640
that I had a colleague help find.

28:07.200 --> 28:07.880
You've received it?

28:10.720 --> 28:11.750
Aren't you going to thank me?

28:13.200 --> 28:14.310
Thank you.

28:14.790 --> 28:15.440
I'm off.

28:17.960 --> 28:20.720
♫I'm just like you♫

28:21.270 --> 28:23.830
♫Strong like you♫

29:34.400 --> 29:36.000
Mom, are you asleep?

29:46.720 --> 29:47.270
What's the matter?

29:47.750 --> 29:48.680
You've a boyfriend now?

30:13.720 --> 30:14.590
Why are you here?

30:17.110 --> 30:18.070
You're drunk again.

30:19.640 --> 30:20.400
Get up.

30:29.160 --> 30:30.160
Slowly, slowly.

30:32.400 --> 30:33.640
How much did you drink?

30:35.680 --> 30:36.400
Don't fall.

31:20.590 --> 31:21.680
You bought these tickets?

31:26.200 --> 31:27.070
Of course.

31:27.680 --> 31:29.920
If I hadn't bought it, could I have snatched it?

31:36.440 --> 31:38.000
I saw both of you

31:39.160 --> 31:41.270
at the crayfish restaurant just now.

31:41.680 --> 31:42.680
Why didn't you come over?

31:45.880 --> 31:47.440
You two seemed to be having a good time.

31:47.440 --> 31:48.640
I didn't want to disturb you.

31:48.830 --> 31:50.070
Are you crazy?

31:50.310 --> 31:51.880
Did you drink too much fake alcohol?

31:52.160 --> 31:53.000
I'm wrong.

31:53.550 --> 31:55.240
I'm sorry. I apologize.

31:57.480 --> 31:58.150
Wanghe,

32:01.160 --> 32:02.550
you two are a really good match.

32:05.640 --> 32:09.070
Fenghua is truly good to you.

32:14.830 --> 32:16.070
Isn't Fenghua good to you too?

32:16.400 --> 32:17.480
She's good to me too,

32:19.960 --> 32:21.350
but not in that way.

32:22.750 --> 32:25.350
She's been sticking to you since she was little.

32:27.070 --> 32:29.680
The way she looks at you is different.

32:30.350 --> 32:32.070
Alright, just go to sleep.

32:32.150 --> 32:33.800
Don't dwell on things that don't matter.

32:34.000 --> 32:35.000
Xie Wanghe!

32:43.070 --> 32:44.640
Fenghua is a good girl.

32:45.920 --> 32:46.920
Don't let her down.

32:51.880 --> 32:53.680
If you've made up your mind, be serious about it.

32:55.440 --> 32:56.310
Don't hurt her.

32:57.680 --> 32:58.350
Anything else?

32:59.160 --> 32:59.790
Go on.

33:10.830 --> 33:11.680
Wanghe.

33:14.550 --> 33:15.910
We're like brothers.

33:20.400 --> 33:22.160
I'm begging you to please be good to her.

33:29.160 --> 33:30.160
What does...

33:32.680 --> 33:33.790
happiness mean to you?

33:37.680 --> 33:38.720
Happiness...

33:43.160 --> 33:44.350
Happiness is...

33:46.720 --> 33:49.350
to live life with the person I love,

33:49.830 --> 33:51.400
where we spend our days together.

33:54.080 --> 33:55.920
I think happiness is

33:57.680 --> 33:59.200
letting the person you love

33:59.830 --> 34:01.200
live the life she wants to live.

34:01.550 --> 34:02.630
That's happiness.

34:07.240 --> 34:08.280
What do you mean?

34:11.000 --> 34:12.880
When we were young, Granny Ma always said

34:14.110 --> 34:15.630
girls must be raised with care.

34:16.960 --> 34:18.110
She was right.

34:18.670 --> 34:19.670
So I want to

34:20.480 --> 34:21.670
save up enough to meet this condition.

34:24.840 --> 34:25.400
Wait.

34:28.590 --> 34:30.000
You can't be together if you have no money?

34:30.000 --> 34:30.840
You probably can,

34:32.000 --> 34:33.550
but you won't be happy.

34:35.360 --> 34:36.840
Then your parents...

34:40.960 --> 34:42.320
Haikuo's parents,

34:45.670 --> 34:46.670
and my parents...

34:52.880 --> 34:54.630
Since young, Fenghua was raised

34:55.920 --> 34:57.070
as a boy by her family.

34:57.470 --> 34:59.440
She's open-minded and easy to raise.

35:00.070 --> 35:01.640
But I just want to have

35:02.710 --> 35:04.590
the ability and conditions

35:06.190 --> 35:07.230
to pamper her one day.

35:10.400 --> 35:11.400
Before that,

35:11.760 --> 35:12.920
I don't want to make empty promises

35:13.230 --> 35:14.470
or commit to a future.

35:20.000 --> 35:21.230
If you aren't going to take action,

35:22.840 --> 35:24.150
can I take my chances first?

35:25.360 --> 35:26.670
Can I, Xie Wanghe?

35:28.440 --> 35:29.630
I'm asking you.

35:35.640 --> 35:36.710
If you want to pursue her,

35:38.230 --> 35:39.230
no one's stopping you,

35:39.960 --> 35:40.960
nor can anyone stop you.

35:45.280 --> 35:46.550
I'm going to find her now.

35:51.150 --> 35:51.840
Xingchi.

35:54.230 --> 35:56.150
If you think you have the ability

35:56.590 --> 35:57.670
to make her happy,

35:58.190 --> 35:59.630
not only will I not stop you,

36:00.230 --> 36:01.510
I will also give you my blessings.

36:04.710 --> 36:06.190
I may not be good enough now,

36:06.920 --> 36:08.280
but that doesn't mean I won't be in the future.

36:08.760 --> 36:09.590
Making empty promises, huh?

36:10.920 --> 36:11.830
Is there any point in that?

36:13.230 --> 36:14.590
A property or a car.

36:15.440 --> 36:17.480
That's definitely not happening in the short term.

36:19.190 --> 36:21.110
But you should at least have a proper place to stay, no?

36:21.110 --> 36:21.880
I do have one!

36:21.880 --> 36:22.960
That basement, huh?

36:23.440 --> 36:25.280
Are you going to get Fenghua to squeeze in with you,

36:25.670 --> 36:27.320
or are you going to mooch off her place?

36:27.950 --> 36:28.590
That works too.

36:29.760 --> 36:30.910
She has a canteen.

36:31.320 --> 36:32.470
You'll even save on food expenses.

36:34.230 --> 36:35.000
Congratulations.

38:20.920 --> 38:21.630
Tell me in detail.

38:21.840 --> 38:22.840
Let's talk about Yuntu first.

38:23.760 --> 38:25.230
Their biggest problem now

38:25.230 --> 38:26.280
is the chaotic assignment of orders.

38:26.590 --> 38:27.400
As soon as delivery riders

38:27.400 --> 38:28.160
log into the app,

38:28.160 --> 38:29.630
it starts to assign order frantically.

38:30.230 --> 38:32.670
Such a model seems efficient,

38:32.800 --> 38:35.360
but it actually ignores the riders' feelings.

38:35.960 --> 38:38.110
Riders will feel like they're being frantically exploited,

38:38.190 --> 38:40.230
as if they're being whipped to keep moving.

38:40.840 --> 38:42.710
Having an active or passive choice

38:42.920 --> 38:44.840
makes a big difference for individuals.

38:45.000 --> 38:46.710
Yuntu is slow in adjusting order prices.

38:47.110 --> 38:48.670
And that does not match the pace of delivery.

38:49.000 --> 38:49.870
For example,

38:50.190 --> 38:51.440
for orders in more remote areas,

38:51.800 --> 38:53.000
riders are reluctant to accept them.

38:53.030 --> 38:55.590
In this case, the price should be continuously increased

38:55.590 --> 38:56.960
until someone accepts the order.

38:56.960 --> 38:59.030
But Yuntu's response is much slower.

38:59.670 --> 39:01.590
This way, even when the customer receives their meal,

39:01.760 --> 39:03.280
the customer experience is still poor

39:04.440 --> 39:05.800
due to the long delay.

39:06.280 --> 39:07.360
Customers often ask,

39:07.360 --> 39:09.030
'Why hasn't any rider accepted my order?'

39:09.590 --> 39:11.510
If no rider accepts the order for a long time,

39:11.510 --> 39:12.960
customers will cancel the order.

39:13.000 --> 39:14.280
The restaurant doesn't make money

39:14.360 --> 39:15.760
and even has to bear with the losses.

39:16.550 --> 39:17.440
If this continues,

39:17.590 --> 39:19.360
we'll lose many merchants.

39:28.630 --> 39:28.960
Hello?

39:29.070 --> 39:29.400
Hello?

39:29.550 --> 39:30.110
Where are you?

39:30.110 --> 39:31.510
I'm in a meeting. Let's talk later.

39:31.960 --> 39:33.480
Hurry and watch the CCTV News channel now.

39:33.630 --> 39:34.960
The Grand Canal's application for World Heritage status has been successful.

39:36.070 --> 39:36.760
Really?

39:37.030 --> 39:37.590
Recently,

39:37.760 --> 39:39.590
at the 38th World Heritage Committee meeting

39:39.590 --> 39:42.400
held in Doha, Qatar,

39:43.280 --> 39:44.880
The Grand Canal, a cultural heritage project

39:44.880 --> 39:47.230
independently proposed by our country,

39:47.960 --> 39:51.230
has been successfully added to the World Heritage list.

39:51.880 --> 39:53.840
World Cultural Heritage, huh?

39:54.710 --> 39:55.880
It's the world!

39:57.590 --> 39:59.920
Our Grand Canal, along with the Great Wall,

40:00.550 --> 40:01.230
the Forbidden City,

40:01.840 --> 40:03.550
the Summer Palace, Potala Palace,

40:03.840 --> 40:04.670
and Longmen Grottoes,

40:05.710 --> 40:07.510
will all be on the same level now.

40:07.550 --> 40:08.030
Right?

40:08.550 --> 40:09.230
What does this mean?

40:09.440 --> 40:11.550
It means that when tourists come to Flower Street in the future,

40:11.590 --> 40:12.880
they'll have to buy tickets.

40:13.360 --> 40:14.840
It means that we'll have to raise the prices

40:14.840 --> 40:15.880
of our family's tofu pudding.

40:17.880 --> 40:20.030
Now that the application is successful,

40:20.030 --> 40:21.590
it means our Grand Canal

40:21.590 --> 40:23.360
will soon see a revival.

40:23.750 --> 40:25.510
The economy along both sides of the canal

40:25.510 --> 40:26.550
will develop rapidly.

40:26.670 --> 40:28.190
Good times are ahead.

40:28.510 --> 40:29.030
Yanlin!

40:29.480 --> 40:30.360
Come, come.

40:30.800 --> 40:32.710
Find some time to tidy up our restaurant.

40:33.110 --> 40:34.710
It’s time for some repairs and fixes.

40:35.230 --> 40:36.800
Don't let it look all run-down, you know?

40:36.800 --> 40:37.840
It'll bring shame to Flower Street.

40:37.840 --> 40:39.360
Don't worry, I've already arranged it.

40:39.710 --> 40:40.550
Mr. Zhou.

40:40.840 --> 40:43.150
If Flower Street becomes more popular in the future,

40:43.190 --> 40:45.510
business will surely be better than before, right?

40:45.550 --> 40:46.360
Of course.

40:46.360 --> 40:47.880
Not just on both banks, but on the river too.

40:47.960 --> 40:49.150
Business on the water

40:49.150 --> 40:50.400
will gradually improve as well.

40:51.510 --> 40:52.670
So you're saying that we can

40:52.670 --> 40:53.880
make money by seafaring again, right?

40:53.920 --> 40:55.070
What do you mean, Boss Xie?

40:55.510 --> 40:56.070
You have an itch to scratch, don't you?

40:56.070 --> 40:56.920
An itch?

40:59.230 --> 41:00.960
No, we should still wait and see.

41:01.230 --> 41:02.070
Let's see how it goes.

41:02.960 --> 41:04.230
But to be honest,

41:04.230 --> 41:05.960
Mr. Shao really contributed a lot

41:06.030 --> 41:07.550
to the success of this UNESCO heritage application.

41:08.110 --> 41:08.550
That's right.

41:09.440 --> 41:10.550
I wouldn't say I contributed much.

41:11.280 --> 41:12.440
I just helped a little bit.

41:15.550 --> 41:16.760
Before this,

41:17.110 --> 41:18.710
together with Mr. Zhou, Chen Bo,

41:19.070 --> 41:19.840
and Chen Rui,

41:20.070 --> 41:23.070
we've been studying that sunken ship in the canal.

41:24.480 --> 41:26.670
We could strongly prove that

41:27.070 --> 41:28.670
more than a hundred years ago,

41:29.030 --> 41:30.190
this Grand Canal was

41:30.190 --> 41:31.750
part of the Silk Road.

41:32.110 --> 41:33.480
And we concluded that

41:33.880 --> 41:35.550
our Grand Canal

41:35.550 --> 41:37.070
played a role in history that was

41:37.440 --> 41:39.840
much greater than the Suez Canal.

41:39.960 --> 41:41.000
Don't you think that's impressive?

41:41.000 --> 41:42.150
Impressive.

41:42.920 --> 41:44.550
Don't listen to his nonsense.

41:45.070 --> 41:45.760
Well, I...

41:46.070 --> 41:48.150
We only proved that there was a ship

41:48.360 --> 41:49.510
that had an Italian on board.

41:49.510 --> 41:51.110
Then this ship sailed north,

41:51.440 --> 41:52.840
and later, near our area,

41:53.800 --> 41:55.800
they encountered some pirates

41:55.800 --> 41:56.920
and finally sank.

41:57.400 --> 41:58.710
As for the conclusions,

41:59.070 --> 42:00.230
most of them are speculation.

42:00.280 --> 42:02.030
We don't have enough historical evidence to prove it.

42:02.070 --> 42:03.630
It doesn't have academic value.

42:04.230 --> 42:05.510
You're not writing a thesis.

42:05.550 --> 42:07.480
Why do you need academic value?

42:07.880 --> 42:10.000
We submitted the materials as part of our application,

42:10.000 --> 42:10.440
didn't we?

42:10.510 --> 42:11.710
And they've given us an acknowledgement.

42:11.710 --> 42:12.590
What does this mean?

42:13.070 --> 42:14.880
It means they've seriously looked at it.

42:15.510 --> 42:16.550
Whether or not it's valuable,

42:16.550 --> 42:18.760
it's not for us to determine, right?

42:19.230 --> 42:20.560
Alright. I won't argue with you anymore.

42:20.560 --> 42:22.670
You're the biggest hero for this successful UNESCO heritage application.

42:22.710 --> 42:24.000
Yes, that's right.

42:25.190 --> 42:26.110
As for us,

42:26.110 --> 42:27.360
we've only proven that

42:27.360 --> 42:29.960
there was indeed an Italian on this ship.

42:30.550 --> 42:32.670
But who was he?

42:32.950 --> 42:34.630
Where did he come from and where was he going?

42:34.630 --> 42:35.710
What was he doing in China?

42:36.070 --> 42:37.480
We have to keep investigating.

42:38.480 --> 42:40.550
Even if we end up finding nothing,

42:40.550 --> 42:41.400
the process itself

42:41.550 --> 42:43.670
can help us uncover more about

42:43.670 --> 42:44.710
the history of Flower Street.

42:44.960 --> 42:46.510
That would be a great achievement for us too.

42:46.760 --> 42:47.110
That's right.

42:47.110 --> 42:47.480
Isn't it?

42:47.550 --> 42:48.000
Yes, yes.

42:48.030 --> 42:48.510
Right?

42:48.510 --> 42:49.110
It certainly is.

42:49.110 --> 42:51.190
I want to visit the Suez Canal.

42:51.190 --> 42:52.960
You look just like the Suez Canal to me.

42:55.840 --> 42:57.360
The celebration is starting, hurry up!

42:57.360 --> 42:58.000
It's starting, it's starting!

42:58.030 --> 42:58.760
Come on, come on!

42:58.760 --> 42:59.920
Let's go, let's go!

43:00.000 --> 43:01.760
The flags, the flags!

43:01.760 --> 43:03.510
We got them!
